  "rulesText": "When you **Wreck**, your work is much quieter than it should be and the damage is very well-hidden from casual inspection.",
  "commentary": "You can drill holes in things, melt stuff with acid, even use a muffled explosive, and it will all be very quiet and extremely hard to notice.",
